1
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:07,160
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,840
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:16,160
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,440
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,360
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,800
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,360
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,840
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,640
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,600
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,480
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,680
(Based on Hongshu.com's Novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,680
=Episode 11=

17
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,119
Matron Zhou!

18
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,320
Hadn't you retired to the countryside?

19
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,359
The moment I heard you sent for me,

20
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,960
every ache and pain vanished!

21
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:03,679
(Matron Zhou)
I can serve you another twenty years!

22
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,920
Greetings, Your Majesty.

23
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,000
(Her mother died young.)

24
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:09,079
(In her memories,)

25
00:01:09,359 --> 00:01:11,159
(Matron Zhou was like a mother to her.)

26
00:01:11,959 --> 00:01:12,840
Wet nurse...

27
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,760
Please get up, Matron.

28
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:18,400
You needn't bow to me.

29
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:19,599
Your Majesty,

30
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,200
I've come too late.

31
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,840
All this time in the Cold Palace...

32
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:28,760
Yinshuang.

33
00:01:28,959 --> 00:01:29,799
Take her to rest.

34
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:30,599
Get her some shaved ice.

35
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:41,400
Thank you, Eunuch Cao,

36
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,480
for bringing her here.

37
00:01:42,879 --> 00:01:43,920
Thank His Majesty for me.

38
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:51,200
(What's that supposed to mean?)

39
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:53,480
Oh, dear.

40
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:56,159
I searched high and low

41
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:58,239
before I found Matron Zhou.

42
00:01:58,239 --> 00:02:00,359
I crossed two mountains to find her!

43
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:01,079
Look.

44
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,120
I've worn right through my boots.

45
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,560
(Oh, he's fishing for a reward.)

46
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:08,560
Thank you for your trouble, Eunuch Cao.

47
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,680
In this heat,

48
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,400
even money won't cool me down.

49
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,800
Why didn't you say so?

50
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,520
Yinshuang.

51
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:20,400
Give Eunuch Cao one of each

52
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,560
of our new refreshments.

53
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,879
No, make that two.

54
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,000
Let His Majesty try them.

55
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:24,680
Oh!

56
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,560
How thoughtful, Your Majesty.

57
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:29,120
This famine has His Majesty distressed.

58
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:31,199
These will help soothe his temper.

59
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,080
I take my leave.

60
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,360
Half a year ago,

61
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,400
I learned that

62
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,759
disaster had struck the Lu family.

63
00:02:43,759 --> 00:02:45,080
I rushed there overnight,

64
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:48,159
but the Lu estate was sealed shut.

65
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:50,199
You had entered the palace.

66
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,800
I could only return to my village.

67
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,759
You've suffered, Matron.

68
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,400
I've managed.

69
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:01,960
I still had some savings.

70
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:04,039
But in our village,

71
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,360
seven or eight families
starved to death.

72
00:03:07,199 --> 00:03:08,159
Starved to death?

73
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:10,039
Didn't the court help?

74
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:12,000
Some relief grain was sent.

75
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,280
But when we opened the sacks,

76
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:15,800
it was old, moldy, full of insects.

77
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,479
Unfit to eat.

78
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,560
One dish at the Dowager's banquet

79
00:03:22,719 --> 00:03:24,039
could feed the starving for six months!

80
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:26,520
Ji Wujue, how could you?

81
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:31,039
Your Majesty, where are you going?

82
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,039
To ask him

83
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:33,919
if he's tired of being Emperor!

84
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,600
(Northern Drought Relief Report)

85
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,919
Is the Revenue Ministry useless?

86
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:48,199
Do you all want to lose your heads?

87
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:50,159
Please hear me out, Your Majesty.

88
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:52,639
Months of drought, then sudden storms!

89
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,400
Even the Imperial Observatory
failed to warn us.

90
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,199
The granaries were in disrepair.

91
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:58,439
We had no time to save the grain.

92
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:01,439
A full 50,000 shi of grain!
[*shi = ancient weight unit]

93
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,680
Enough to feed 10,000 for a year!

94
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:06,879
And you dismiss it

95
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,080
as poor storage?

96
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,319
I...

97
00:04:09,919 --> 00:04:11,280
I deserve death.

98
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:13,319
I shall atone with my life!

99
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,840
Don't, Minister Wang!

100
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:23,720
I've failed Your Majesty!

101
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:27,000
I've failed the people!

102
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:34,240
So he didn't know either.

103
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,360
Blame won't help.

104
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:40,079
We must address
the grain shortage first.

105
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,800
Want to die?

106
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:50,240
Put this right first.

107
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,959
Issue my decree.

108
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,360
Open the treasury.

109
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:55,120
Buy grain at a premium.

110
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,600
But

111
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,920
supplies are low everywhere.

112
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,839
They may last only a month.

113
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:05,279
We must ease the people's suffering now.

114
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,839
I've already sent

115
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:10,199
an urgent dispatch to Liu.

116
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,120
We are allied by marriage.

117
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,959
Buying their spare grain should be easy.

118
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:18,800
But it's a long journey.

119
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,160
I'll escort the grain myself.

120
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:24,439
Please let me make amends, Your Majesty.

121
00:05:28,199 --> 00:05:29,000
Granted.

122
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,399
If anything else goes wrong,

123
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:33,680
you'll answer with your head.

124
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,319
As you command.

125
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,480
(Beans and millet are staples here.)

126
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,360
(Millet yields only about 3 shi.)

127
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,560
(Beans yield even less.)

128
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,399
(If I introduce wheat,)

129
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,439
(at 10 shi per mu,)

130
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:48,000
(no one will have to go hungry again.)

131
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,720
Your Majesty.

132
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,399
Consort Yao requests an audience.

133
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:53,680
What does she want?

134
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,199
(Is she about to try that?)

135
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,199
I take my leave.

136
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:04,120
(Time to go!)

137
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:06,279
(Running into her would be awkward.)

138
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,399
Where are you going?

139
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:20,279
Your Majesty.

140
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,959
Wasn't I a foolish ruler?

141
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,959
Where's that fire you had
when you scolded me?

142
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,160
You're wise and mighty, Your Majesty.

143
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:31,240
I failed to see your wisdom.

144
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,360
Eunuch Cao.

145
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:34,639
Where is His Majesty?

146
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,040
Please wait, Your Highness.

147
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,480
I'll announce you.

148
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:40,519
I'll leave you to it, Your Majesty.

149
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:43,319
I should go.

150
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:53,519
Did I say you could leave?

151
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,920
You're not going anywhere.

152
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,519
Send Consort Yao in.

153
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,639
Your Majesty!

154
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,839
I'll deal with you when I'm back.

155
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:07,639
Your Majesty.

156
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,319
Your Majesty!

157
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,480
Your Majesty.

158
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,600
I have

159
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,800
a wonderful surprise

160
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:17,439
for you.

161
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:23,879
I wish to speak with His Majesty alone.

162
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,519
Out, you old servant!

163
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:32,439
Your Majesty,

164
00:07:32,879 --> 00:07:33,879
just now,

165
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:37,279
I saw Minister Wang leave
looking dejected.

166
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:40,639
Did that old fool upset you?

167
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,680
Consorts must not meddle in politics.

168
00:07:45,199 --> 00:07:46,560
Have you forgotten the rules?

169
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,879
Your Majesty,

170
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:51,360
I only worry about you

171
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:53,959
and wish to ease your burdens.

172
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:57,879
You should see a physician.

173
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:02,720
I am indeed ill.

174
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,480
My ailment

175
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,199
is lovesickness.

176
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:09,120
Such improper behavior.

177
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:12,079
Didn't your family teach you decorum?

178
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,439
(Cold words, warm heart.)

179
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,680
(He does know how to flirt.)

180
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:19,560
Decorum doesn't interest me.

181
00:08:19,839 --> 00:08:23,000
(Royal Bedroom Secrets)
I've been studying something new.

182
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:26,440
(Royal Bedroom Secrets)

183
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:34,039
How did you get that book?

184
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,279
(It really is his!)

185
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:37,840
(Lady Lu didn't lie.)

186
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,840
(The nerve of her!)

187
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,039
(Stealing from beneath my pillow!)

188
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,799
Do you like

189
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:52,759
this style, Your Majesty?

190
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:57,399
Who told you to dress like this?

191
00:08:57,519 --> 00:09:00,039
Lady Lu designed it just for me.

192
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:01,799
It cost me 10,000 taels.

193
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,399
Cao Zhongquan!

194
00:09:04,559 --> 00:09:05,320
Here, Your Majesty.

195
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,879
Take this shameless woman

196
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,399
back to her palace.

197
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,399
But...

198
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,799
Your Majesty!

199
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:16,600
I only did what Lady Lu taught me!

200
00:09:16,759 --> 00:09:20,120
Your Majesty!

201
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,440
Lu Yunluo!

202
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,519
Your Majesty,

203
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:34,799
shall I bring the Empress back?

204
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,840
I don't want to see her.

205
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,039
To Consort Lan's.

206
00:09:39,559 --> 00:09:40,399
Yes, Your Majesty.

207
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:44,360
To Liuyun Palace!

208
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:47,200
(Liuyun Palace)

209
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,240
Your Highness!

210
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,919
What is it?

211
00:09:51,919 --> 00:09:53,000
Why are you so flustered?

212
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:53,840
His Majesty is here!

213
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,720
His first visit to Liuyun Palace!

214
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,720
His Majesty?

215
00:09:58,519 --> 00:09:59,759
He's already at the gate.

216
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,399
He favored Sister Lu only yesterday
at Shuxin Hall.

217
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:09,399
Today he comes running to me.

218
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,639
It's true, then.

219
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,679
Emperors are fickle.

220
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:14,960
Always eyeing someone else.

221
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,000
Mind your words, Your Highness!

222
00:10:17,559 --> 00:10:18,799
Let's greet him.

223
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:21,159
See what His Majesty wants.

224
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:21,840
Yes.

225
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:27,200
(Liuyun Palace)

226
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,639
Consort Lan is rather aloof.

227
00:10:29,639 --> 00:10:32,240
Consort Yao would have rushed out.

228
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,799
I actually like it.

229
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:37,440
Greetings, Your Majesty.

230
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,519
Rise.

231
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,399
Mother's birthday draws near.

232
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:51,639
I hear you're arranging everything.

233
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:54,120
The Empress Dowager gave the order.

234
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,399
I simply do as she asks.

235
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,120
Good.

236
00:11:04,039 --> 00:11:05,159
I hear

237
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:07,039
Liu has enjoyed fine weather

238
00:11:07,519 --> 00:11:08,559
with abundant harvests.

239
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,960
You've been here a while, Consort Lan.

240
00:11:10,279 --> 00:11:11,840
Do you miss your homeland?

241
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:15,120
Please speak plainly, Your Majesty.

242
00:11:18,279 --> 00:11:19,080
Very well.

243
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,200
I've come today

244
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,159
to ask a favor.

245
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:27,000
Drought has struck Donglan.

246
00:11:27,759 --> 00:11:28,840
Grain is scarce.

247
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,480
I wish to buy grain from Liu.

248
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,759
I hope

249
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,519
you will write

250
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,559
and ask the King of Liu for help.

251
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,600
You came today

252
00:11:40,159 --> 00:11:41,480
just for that?

253
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:44,320
Yes.

254
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,399
(I've neglected her)

255
00:11:46,759 --> 00:11:48,080
(ever since she arrived.)

256
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,960
(Will she agree?)

257
00:11:55,519 --> 00:11:56,480
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

258
00:11:56,559 --> 00:11:58,120
I'll write to my father at once.

259
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,919
You've done me a great service.

260
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,120
Name your reward.

261
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:09,039
Here in the palace,

262
00:12:09,039 --> 00:12:11,039
I have no kin, and little to do.

263
00:12:11,159 --> 00:12:12,440
I'd like your permission

264
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,440
to visit the Cold Palace freely

265
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,559
and eat with Sister Lu...

266
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:16,919
I mean, talk with her.

267
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:19,919
Lu Yunluo?

268
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:21,120
Yes.

269
00:12:26,519 --> 00:12:27,320
Granted.

270
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:28,919
Thank you, Your Majesty.

271
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,600
(Why does everything lead back to her?)

272
00:12:31,919 --> 00:12:34,279
(Did she put a potion in the water?)

273
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,279
Your Majesty,

274
00:12:38,519 --> 00:12:39,600
was there anything else?

275
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,200
I'll be going.

276
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,799
Consorts through the ages

277
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:53,759
fought tooth and nail for favor.

278
00:12:53,919 --> 00:12:54,879
Yet here I am,

279
00:12:55,039 --> 00:12:56,399
an unwanted burden,

280
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,039
unwelcome everywhere.

281
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,240
Am I

282
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:02,200
some kind of jinx?

283
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,759
Peace in the inner palace

284
00:13:04,759 --> 00:13:06,399
and harmony among your consorts

285
00:13:06,399 --> 00:13:08,200
are blessings, Your Majesty.

286
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,200
To the Cold...

287
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,639
Never mind.

288
00:13:17,559 --> 00:13:18,440
From today,

289
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,360
triple the business tax

290
00:13:20,639 --> 00:13:22,320
on every Cold Palace shop.

291
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,519
But...

292
00:13:23,519 --> 00:13:25,240
Her Majesty loves money more than life.

293
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,080
She'll

294
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,879
surely make quite a scene.

295
00:13:30,279 --> 00:13:32,720
Let her come bargain with me herself.

296
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:59,040
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

297
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:03,720
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

298
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:08,040
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

299
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:12,480
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

300
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:16,680
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

301
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:21,080
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

302
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:24,880
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

303
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:30,040
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

304
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,840
♪No finery to rival spring♪

305
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:38,320
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

306
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:42,440
♪Where is beauty found?♪

307
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:47,160
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

308
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

309
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,360
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

310
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:53,800
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

311
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

312
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

313
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,360
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

314
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,840
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

315
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:07,200
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
